{"Title":"An Act designating a portion of state highway Route 23 west and 41 south in the town of Egremont as the George McGurn memorial highway","BillNumber":"H4619","DocketNumber":"HD5052","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"WSP1","Name":"Smitty Pignatelli","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WSP1","ResponseDate":"2024-04-10T16:14:15.733"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"WSP1","Name":"Smitty Pignatelli","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WSP1","ResponseDate":"2024-04-10T16:14:15.7333333"},{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2024-04-11T15:48:52.0666667"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"PWM0","Name":"Paul W. Mark","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PWM0","ResponseDate":"2024-04-11T15:48:52.05"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4619/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Pignatelli of Lenox and Senator Mark, a joint petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Smitty Pignatelli and Paul W. Mark for legislation to designate a portion of state highway Routes 23 west and 41 south in the town of Egremont as the George McGurn memorial highway.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tThe portion of Egremont Main Road, state highway route 23 west and 41 south, in the town of Egremont from Creamery Road to North Undermountain Road shall be designated and known as the George McGurn Memorial highway. The Massachusetts Department of Transportation is hereby directed to erect suitable markers along said highway bearing said designation in accordance with the standards of the department.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","